{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s15BitwiseCopyableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/View"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EmptyView","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A view that doesn’t contain any content."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EmptyView"}],"role":"symbol","title":"EmptyView","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EmptyView","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9EmptyViewV","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct"},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EmptyView\/init()"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"anchor":"Type-Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EmptyView\/Body"],"title":"Type Aliases","generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EmptyView\/View-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EmptyView"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You will rarely, if ever, need to create an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EmptyView"},{"type":"text","text":" directly. Instead,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EmptyView"},{"type":"text","text":" represents the absence of a view."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenSwiftUI uses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EmptyView"},{"type":"text","text":" in situations where a OpenSwiftUI view type defines one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or more child views with generic parameters, and allows the child views to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be absent. When absent, the child view’s type in the generic type parameter"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EmptyView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example creates an indeterminate "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProgressView"},{"type":"text","text":" without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a label. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProgressView"},{"type":"text","text":" type declares two generic parameters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Label"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CurrentValueLabel"},{"type":"text","text":", for the types used by its subviews."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"When both subviews are absent, like they are here, the resulting type is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProgressView<EmptyView, EmptyView>"},{"type":"text","text":", as indicated by the example’s output:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["let progressView = ProgressView()","print(\"\\(type(of:progressView))\")","\/\/ Prints: ProgressView<EmptyView, EmptyView>"],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/emptyview"],"traits